    "Your safari booking has been approved! We are excited to welcome you to Tanzania for an unforgettable adventure.": "Je safari-boeking is goedgekeurd! We zijn onder de indruk van je inkomst nach Tanzania te zullen",
    "Approved Booking Details": "Gegevens van de goedgekeurde boeking",
    "Our team will be in touch soon with detailed itinerary information and preparation tips for your trip!": "Ons team zal binnenkort contact met je opnemen voor gedetailleerde reisroutegegevens en voorbereidingstips voor je reis!",
    "View Our Website": "Bekijk onze website",
    "Sharing the breathtaking beauty, wildlife, and culture of Tanzania with travelers from around the globe.": "Delen van Tanzania's wildernis, cultuur und teilen Sie die Wildtiere.",
    "Twina Safaris was founded with a simple mission: to share the breathtaking beauty, wildlife, and culture of Tanzania with travelers from around the world. What started as a passion for adventure and nature has grown into a trusted safari company dedicated to creating unforgettable travel experiences.": "Delen van Tanzania's wildernis, cultuur und teilen Sie die Wildtiere.",
    "From the endless plains of the Serengeti to the majestic peak of Mount Kilimanjaro and the pristine beaches of Zanzibar, we believe every journey should be more than just a trip—it should be a life-changing experience. Our team combines local knowledge, professional expertise, and genuine hospitality to ensure that every guest discovers the true spirit of Africa.": "Van de eindeloze vlaktes van de Serengeti tot het majestueuze kapelbergen van de Kilimanjaro en de ongemarterde stranden van Zanzibar waren we van mening dat elke reis meer dan een reis moet zijn – een levensverandering. Ons team combineert lokale kenniss, professionele expertise en echte gastvrijheid.",
